WEBVTT

00:17:27.221 --> 00:17:30.230
In other words,
we can't create supermodel mice.

00:17:30.254 --> 00:17:31.515
(Laughter)

00:17:31.539 --> 00:17:33.583
And this speaks to the role
of angiogenesis

00:17:33.607 --> 00:17:35.404
in regulating healthy set points.

00:17:36.504 --> 00:17:38.411
Albert Szent-Györgi once said,

00:17:38.435 --> 00:17:40.976
"Discovery consists of seeing
what everyone has seen,

00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:42.896
and thinking what no one has thought."

00:17:43.261 --> 00:17:44.691
I hope I've convinced you

00:17:44.715 --> 00:17:47.975
that for diseases like cancer,
obesity and other conditions,

00:17:47.999 --> 00:17:49.821
there may be a great power

00:17:49.845 --> 00:17:52.972
in attacking their common
denominator: angiogenesis.

00:17:52.996 --> 00:17:55.052
And that's what I think
the world needs now.

00:17:55.076 --> 00:17:56.227
Thank you.

00:17:56.251 --> 00:18:02.626
(Applause)